{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"43":"General Behavior (Kitab Al-Adab)"},"section_detail":{"43":{"hadithnumber_first":4773,"hadithnumber_last":5274,"arabicnumber_first":4773,"arabicnumber_last":5274,"name_native":"كتاب الآداب"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4923,"arabicnumber":4923,"text":"حدثنا الحسن بن علي، حدثنا عبد الرزاق، اخبرنا معمر، عن ثابت، عن انس، قال لما قدم رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم المدينة لعبت الحبشة لقدومه فرحا بذلك لعبوا بحرابهم","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":43,"hadith":151}}]}